bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    vulkan_damage_plan_present_api_absent_orphaned_specs_2026-11-28, 0, "Three specs target a VulkanBackend/Engine2D present_damage_plan(plan: DamageFramePlan) -> bool API with damage_readback_calls/rects/bytes, damage_full_fallbacks, present_mode, present_attempted, present_completed, present_transfer_bytes/rects, present_full_frame and present_device_present receipts. None of it exists in src/ on release/1.0.0 8dd50786560 (grep present_damage_plan src/ = 0 hits; origin/main backend_vulkan.spl = 0 hits; 88aac2ffe28 transplant = 0 hits). The specs arrived in the 2026-09-29 transplant 88aac2ffe28 without the implementation. Production uses stage_present_damage(rects) + present() with per-frame present_readback_bytes / present_full_readback_count / frame_* receipts instead."
    vulkan_damage_plan_present_api_absent_orphaned_specs_2026-11-28, 1, "Red on this host (seed cargo-target-wm-unitalias-1126 sha256:352b80a734463098, lavapipe): vulkan_damage_present_spec 0/4 passed, vulkan_damage_transfer_contract_spec 0/2, draw_ir_damage_present_route_contract_spec 0/3 executed (ERROR). Owner decision needed: restore the DamageFramePlan presenter API, or retarget the specs to stage_present_damage + present receipts. Specs were not edited, tagged or skipped."

